TITLE Pure water at pH 7.0 equilibrated with 10 moles of gypsum

SOLUTION 1
    temp      25
    pH        7.0
    pe        4
    units     mol/L
    water     1  # kg

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Gypsum    0.0    10.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file     gypsum_equilibrium.sel
    -reset    false
    -ionic_strength  true
    -totals   Ca S(6)
    -pH       true

END
